WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.850
A variable is a named box. count holds a number.

2
00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:09.679
set count to zero puts zero in the box, and throws the old value away.

3
00:00:10.558 --> 00:00:14.383
change count by one adds one to what is already there.

4
00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:20.322
show number shows the value without changing it.
